@startuml 图像上传与识别流程

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

title 图像上传与识别完整流程\n果蔬智造核心平台 v1.0

actor "用户" as User
participant "前端\n(Vue 3)" as Frontend
participant "后端\n(Rust/Axum)" as Backend
participant "AI 服务\n(FastAPI)" as AI
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
database "Redis" as Cache

== 1. 图像上传阶段 ==

User -> Frontend: 选择图片文件
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Frontend: 客户端验证\n(格式/大小)
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/v1/uploads\n(multipart/form-data)
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: 解析文件\n生成 upload_id
Backend -> DB: INSERT INTO uploads\n(data: BYTEA)
activate DB
DB --> Backend: 返回 upload_id
deactivate DB

Backend -> Backend: 更新状态为\n'processing'

== 2. AI 推理阶段 ==

Backend -> AI: POST /infer\n(upload_id + file bytes)
activate AI

AI -> AI: 图像预处理\n(Resize 224x224)
AI -> AI: DenseNet121 推理\n获取 Top-K 结果
AI -> AI: 质量评估\n(颜色/纹理/新鲜度)
AI -> AI: 生成分级\n(A/B/C)

AI --> Backend: 返回推理结果\n(JSON)
deactivate AI

== 3. 结果持久化阶段 ==

Backend -> Backend: 计算统计数据\n(total/grade_a/b/c)
Backend -> DB: INSERT INTO results\n(detections: JSONB)
activate DB
DB --> Backend: 确认写入
deactivate DB

Backend -> DB: UPDATE uploads\nSET status='completed'
activate DB
DB --> Backend: 确认更新
deactivate DB

== 4. 缓存阶段 ==

Backend -> Cache: SET result:<upload_id>\n(JSON, TTL=900s)
activate Cache
Cache --> Backend: OK
deactivate Cache

== 5. 返回响应 ==

Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK\n完整检测结果
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Frontend: 解析结果\n渲染界面
Frontend --> User: 显示检测结果\n(类别/质量/统计)
deactivate Frontend

== 6. 后续查询（可选）==

User -> Frontend: 查看历史记录
activate Frontend
Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/v1/records/:id
activate Backend

Backend -> Cache: GET result:<upload_id>
activate Cache

alt 缓存命中
    Cache --> Backend: 返回缓存数据
    Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK (from cache)
else 缓存未命中
    Cache --> Backend: nil
    deactivate Cache
    Backend -> DB: SELECT * FROM results\nWHERE upload_id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> Backend: 返回数据库记录
    deactivate DB
    Backend -> Cache: 更新缓存
    Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK (from DB)
end

deactivate Backend
Frontend --> User: 显示详细结果
deactivate Frontend

note over User, Cache
  **关键性能指标**
  • 上传处理: < 100ms
  • AI 推理: 200-500ms
  • 数据库写入: < 50ms
  • 缓存写入: < 10ms
  • 总耗时: < 1s
  
  **并发能力**
  • 最大并发上传: 50+
  • AI 服务 QPS: 10-20
  • 数据库连接池: 20
end note

@enduml
